000010* LINAGE: page body, footing, top and bottom margins,
000020* LINAGE-COUNTER and AT END-OF-PAGE.
000030 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000040 PROGRAM-ID. FILELIN.
000050 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000060 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000070 FILE-CONTROL.
000080     SELECT RPT ASSIGN TO "paged.txt"
000090        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS FS.
000100 DATA DIVISION.
000110 FILE SECTION.
000120 FD RPT LINAGE 6 FOOTING 5 TOP 1 BOTTOM 2.
000130 01 RLINE          PIC X(30).
